{"id":"wb-8-457","name":"乃宁曲德寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"乃宁曲德寺","text":"乃宁曲德寺，简称“乃宁寺”，又译“南尼寺”，位于西藏自治区日喀则地区康马县南尼乡南尼村，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院。中国大陆称木龙年战争中发生在该寺的战斗为“乃宁寺大血战”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%83%E5%AE%81%E6%9B%B2%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93287589,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93287589","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}